[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1202.23, "timestamp": "00:20:02", "text": "感觉离得那么近，却又感觉如此遥远"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1204.15, "timestamp": "00:20:04", "text": "遥不可及。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1206.07, "timestamp": "00:20:06", "text": "它就在隔壁房间，但你永远也到不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1209.35, "timestamp": "00:20:09", "text": "到那个房间去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1212.07, "timestamp": "00:20:12", "text": "或者就像一个障碍物挡住了你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1215.07, "timestamp": "00:20:15", "text": "墙推不动或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1217.35, "timestamp": "00:20:17", "text": "类似的事情。是的，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1220.549, "timestamp": "00:20:20", "text": "那。是的。这种情况也会发生在人身上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1223.11, "timestamp": "00:20:23", "text": "也喜欢任何我想要的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1226.39, "timestamp": "00:20:26", "text": "做了，我就想，是啊，这是生活的一部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1229.909, "timestamp": "00:20:29", "text": "我最终会克服的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1231.35, "timestamp": "00:20:31", "text": "需要一段时间，但确实每个人都会喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1236.39, "timestamp": "00:20:36", "text": "必须投入大量精力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1239.87, "timestamp": "00:20:39", "text": "尽管。我不喜欢那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1242.11, "timestamp": "00:20:42", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1248.39, "timestamp": "00:20:48", "text": "初次见面？实际上，这是通过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1250.789, "timestamp": "00:20:50", "text": "是樱花吧？我的天啊。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1253.51, "timestamp": "00:20:53", "text": "记住，因为我不知道是哪个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1255.669, "timestamp": "00:20:55", "text": "是你先来，还是铃木先来？我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1258.31, "timestamp": "00:20:58", "text": "记住现在。就像我一直都这么不在状态"}]